&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Investigating &lt;code&gt;timer_create&lt;/code&gt; failure on arm64/alpine (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4586770167" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8744" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8744/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8744"&gt;#8744&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
