&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Improve memory consumption &lt;code&gt;LibrariesInfoCache&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4631870986" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8777" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8777/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8777"&gt;#8777&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
